/*******************************************************************
 * File:        hid_input
 * Purpose:     Turns HID boot-protocol keyboard and mouse reports into
 *              RISC OS low-level key numbers and pointer movement, the
 *              way RISC OS 5's USBDriver (usbkboard, usbmouse) does.
 *              Pure: no SWIs, no statics; the RISC OS side is hid_riscos.
 ******************************************************************/
